{"time": 1763898922, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1691337632", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1049942510", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=348946689]“大概，也就一两天……每天都要采买的。”"}
{"time": 1763899000, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1820749921", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1049942510", "user_id": "1370316409"}, "sender": {"id": "1370316409", "name": "折木"}, "message": "“旅馆里有什么宗教类似的东西吗？”"}
{"time": 1763899001, "type": "recv", "message_id": "497928936", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1049942510", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1524917766]“怎么找呢.....那东西也不一定会散发高光吧”"}
{"time": 1763899007, "type": "recv", "message_id": "542835708", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1049942510", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "她的手缩在胸口，整个人有些畏缩，“白天……这些东西会走的吧？”"}
{"time": 1763899014, "type": "recv", "message_id": "349040321", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1049942510", "user_id": "1370316409"}, "sender": {"id": "1370316409", "name": "折木"}, "message": "“感觉像是某种悬挂的那种护身符的东西”"}
{"time": 1763899054, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1910751741", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1049942510", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“事已至此.. 只能先休息了吗”"}
{"time": 1763899126, "type": "recv", "message_id": "119524171", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1049942510", "user_id": "1370316409"}, "sender": {"id": "1370316409", "name": "折木"}, "message": "“按照怪物的体格打碎门窗简直轻而易举”"}
