{"time": 1763899160, "type": "recv", "message_id": "993736178", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1049942510", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“会不会是鸢尾花呢...”"}
