{"time": 1763899549, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1825904284", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1049942510", "user_id": "1370316409"}, "sender": {"id": "1370316409", "name": "折木"}, "message": "“好像这样是比较合理的”"}
{"time": 1763899566, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1396950319", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1049942510", "user_id": "1370316409"}, "sender": {"id": "1370316409", "name": "折木"}, "message": "“严谨的实验来说，应该分对照组和实验组”"}
{"time": 1763899577, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2068399797", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1049942510", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1061871119]“我也没见过，他布置工作都是留纸条……”"}
{"time": 1763899603, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1200006581", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1049942510", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好神秘...感觉就像幕后黑手一样”"}
{"time": 1763899621, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1456346786", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1049942510", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“没必要这么麻烦，把花丢出去看怪物会不会远离不就好了”"}
{"time": 1763899633, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2111736207", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1049942510", "user_id": "1370316409"}, "sender": {"id": "1370316409", "name": "折木"}, "message": "“先去收集吧”"}
{"time": 1763899650, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2037064145", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1049942510", "user_id": "1370316409"}, "sender": {"id": "1370316409", "name": "折木"}, "message": "“留一个人在门口附近听一下周围的怪物的动静”"}
{"time": 1763899656, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1159173828", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1049942510", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1396950319]你说得正起劲，手袖被梅洛扯了扯，她的状态似乎又差了点，拉着你的手腕子上都出现了细密的鳞片"}
{"time": 1763899693, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1278562010", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1049942510", "user_id": "1370316409"}, "sender": {"id": "1370316409", "name": "折木"}, "message": "“我先去找些水过来，都各自准备一下吧”"}
{"time": 1763899698, "type": "recv", "message_id": "21896249", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1049942510", "user_id": "1370316409"}, "sender": {"id": "1370316409", "name": "折木"}, "message": "*带着梅洛去找水"}
{"time": 1763899738, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1828044804", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1049942510", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "感觉助手小姐有些奇怪，但也没工夫想多余的事情了，去搬一些花来"}
{"time": 1763899800, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1822094202", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1049942510", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "那我看着大门"}
{"time": 1763899807, "type": "recv", "message_id": "927131516", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1049942510", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "小卡握了握手里的厨刀“待会要开门吗？是不是去二楼好些”"}
{"time": 1763899842, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1562956135", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1049942510", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1828044804]紧紧抓着莉兹，不想和她分开哪怕一分一秒"}
{"time": 1763899882, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2147291242", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1049942510", "user_id": "1370316409"}, "sender": {"id": "1370316409", "name": "折木"}, "message": "“如果鸢尾花真有用，开门也不会对我们造成多大影响，如果没用，那才是最绝望的时刻”"}
{"time": 1763899884, "type": "recv", "message_id": "698760001", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1049942510", "user_id": "1370316409"}, "sender": {"id": "1370316409", "name": "折木"}, "message": "*离开"}
{"time": 1763899885, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1477470097", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1049942510", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=21896249]在旅馆里，去哪里找海水?更何况，现在的一楼到处都是黏液。"}
{"time": 1763899912, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2081304481", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1049942510", "user_id": "1370316409"}, "sender": {"id": "1370316409", "name": "折木"}, "message": "“你们知道厨房在什么地方吗？”"}
{"time": 1763899937, "type": "recv", "message_id": "861289375", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1049942510", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“在那边”给医生指了一下，毕竟自己之前也去过"}
{"time": 1763899951, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2034364968", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1049942510", "user_id": "1370316409"}, "sender": {"id": "1370316409", "name": "折木"}, "message": "“好的”"}
{"time": 1763899961, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1832967471", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1049942510", "user_id": "1370316409"}, "sender": {"id": "1370316409", "name": "折木"}, "message": "*带着梅洛过去弄一些盐水"}
{"time": 1763900051, "type": "recv", "message_id": "26827492", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1049942510", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "旅馆里的鸢尾花虽然是早晨才送来的，但现在居然有些衰败的痕迹。"}
{"time": 1763900079, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1595782527", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1049942510", "user_id": "1370316409"}, "sender": {"id": "1370316409", "name": "折木"}, "message": "*等梅洛情况回复后继续说"}
{"time": 1763900083, "type": "recv", "message_id": "673940385", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1049942510", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好奇怪..”但说不定真的有用"}
{"time": 1763900086, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1639515525", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1049942510", "user_id": "1370316409"}, "sender": {"id": "1370316409", "name": "折木"}, "message": "“看鸢尾花现在的情况”"}
{"time": 1763900095, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1403705736", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1049942510", "user_id": "1370316409"}, "sender": {"id": "1370316409", "name": "折木"}, "message": "“可能也并非长期有效”"}
{"time": 1763900102, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1854409765", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1049942510", "user_id": "1370316409"}, "sender": {"id": "1370316409", "name": "折木"}, "message": "“我们要确认未来的方针”"}
{"time": 1763900108, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2095533930", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1049942510", "user_id": "1370316409"}, "sender": {"id": "1370316409", "name": "折木"}, "message": "“出去我们又可以去哪？”"}
{"time": 1763900118, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1465687975", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1049942510", "user_id": "1370316409"}, "sender": {"id": "1370316409", "name": "折木"}, "message": "“这里还有什么地方是安全的”"}
{"time": 1763900154, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1079859527", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1049942510", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1595782527]沾染了一些盐水之后，她的情况没有明显好转，但至少没有恶化的样子。"}
{"time": 1763900204, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1323979670", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1049942510", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“不知道...”无奈的摇了摇头"}
{"time": 1763900358, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1612469623", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1049942510", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "露儿小声和身边的莉兹说了什么，医生和助手亲似乎也在说什么"}
{"time": 1763900415, "type": "recv", "message_id": "631919629", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1049942510", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "小卡则是提着烛台上了楼"}
